</section><section class="section tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow blue">THE MEETING EXPERIENCE</p><h2>A varied, lively<br><em>evening of learning.</em></h2></div><p>Each meeting is structured, but no two are exactly the same. Members take on different roles and help keep the evening moving.</p></div><div class="tiles"><article><span>01</span><h3>Prepared speeches</h3><p>Members present planned speeches to practise structure, delivery and connecting with an audience.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Table Topics®</h3><p>Short, impromptu responses help participants practise organising thoughts and speaking without preparation.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Evaluations</h3><p>Speakers receive encouraging, specific feedback that recognises strengths and suggests ways to improve.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Meeting roles</h3><p>Members practise listening, timekeeping, introductions, facilitation and other leadership skills.</p></article></div></div></section></main>